# Vercel's Root Directory is `frontend`, but the CLI uploads from the repo root and does
# not honour .gitignore here. Without this it walks ~3 GB of local rasters and checkpoints
# and fails on the 100 MB per-file limit. None of it is needed to build the dashboard —
# the API and COGs are served from Modal and Supabase.
.venv
**/__pycache__
backend/data
backend/models/artifacts
backend/secrets
